			"date": "2025-05-23T22:13:37.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Not sure I qualify as a \"web performance expert\", but I have two thumbs and a WPT acct and...um...wow:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.webpagetest.org/video/compare.php?tests=250523_BiDc3Y_JJ0-r:1-c:0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">webpagetest.org/video/compare.</span><span class=\"invisible\">php?tests=250523_BiDc3Y_JJ0-r:1-c:0</span></a></p><p>3MB of JS (11.4 unzipped), almost all of which is critical path. What could go wrong?</p>",
