			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T22:56:41.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>slightlyoff</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> *downloading 100,000 modules...*</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114560042292584688",
			"parentId": "114559446065466986",
			"url": "https://toot.cafe/@aluhrs/114560042160700556",
			"author": {
				"name": "Andy Luhrs",
				"url": "https://toot.cafe/@aluhrs",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/335/803/928/856/970/original/5de5eb17d6022890.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T00:45:18.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>slightlyoff</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Nerdsniping Alex is almost as easy as fixing the perf on this page.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114561197283997580",
			"parentId": "114559573437803508",
			"url": "https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff/114561197023711513",
			"author": {
				"name": "Alex Russell",
				"url": "https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/292/557/125/861/804/original/f19233215012175c.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T05:39:00.000Z",
			"content": "<p>Friends, this is *wild*. Of *course* there's a Markdown engine and LaTeX formatting system in here. How could you build a React + Tailwind-based website without them in 2025?</p><p>But the single largest JS file is a binary encoding of IP ranges to countries, to the tune of 338K on the wire (1.3MB unzipped), *AND IT PULLS IN A TRANSPILED NODE BUFFER IMPLEMENTATION*:</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114561229328896634",
			"parentId": "114561197283997580",
			"url": "https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff/114561229110589994",
			"author": {
				"name": "Alex Russell",
				"url": "https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/292/557/125/861/804/original/f19233215012175c.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T05:47:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p>Zach, is CSS-in-JS the fast way to load fonts? I want to learn from industry luminaries.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
