			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T07:38:21.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>slightlyoff</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I look forward to Jony Ive's reign as head of product design at OpenAI.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114561936507784450",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@patrick_h_lauke/114561936473914065",
			"author": {
				"name": "Patrick H. Lauke",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@patrick_h_lauke",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/299/616/989/749/627/original/35dcc6013f4cadd4.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T08:47:03.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> \"it's a ... quite remarkable engineering achievement\"</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114563316151793084",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@thomasapowell/114563316128624081",
			"author": {
				"name": "ThomasAPowell",
				"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@thomasapowell",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/293/805/019/767/545/original/953acf77563f46ee.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T14:37:55.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@yvg\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>yvg</span></a></span> </p><p>What maybe you all don’t know is that it is designed purposefully as artists like Jony do.   You must understand the brilliance in flaws.  It’s post wabi sabi web design. The flaws are now the point. </p><p>The page is a masterful homage to AI.  The slowness and bloat is in browser performance art commenting on the speed and resource waste of LLMs. It’s executional oddities and fragility a brillant callback to AI answer quality.   </p><p>Pure genius.  👨‍🍳💋👏</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114604380729696198",
